<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 2600s BCE</p><h1 class="research-title">The 27th century BCE</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 2600s BCE, 16 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 5 were founded and 2 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Uruk, the Elamite Confederation and the Mari.</p></header>
